      "content": "This is a decent start, but it feels a bit thin for a Nature Physics submission. I think the critique on the microwave frequency range is the most important part—we need to really hammer that home.\n\nCan you expand this? I need it to feel much more comprehensive. The thoroughness score is currently sitting around 3, and for a journal this prestigious, I really want to see much more structural depth. Make it feel like a very heavy, multi-faceted analysis. \n\nAgain, please make sure the content is actually useful and doesn't just repeat itself, but I really want to see a more robust, highly structured breakdown of the flaws. Try to go deeper into the statistical weaknesses and the fabrication details.",
